t-09/guide.md`\n    22→- **Sheet 10 [Fire Protection Plan]:** Site plan illustrating fire lanes, hydrants, and fire zone details. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-10/guide.md`\n    23→- **Sheet 11 [Grading Plan]:** This sheet displays the detailed grading plan for the development site. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-11/guide.md`\n    24→- **Sheet 12 [Storm Sewer Plan]:** Displays the proposed storm sewer layout and drainage infrastructure details. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-12/guide.md`\n    25→- **Sheet 13 [Drainage Area Map]:** Existing and proposed drainage area maps with summary tables. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-13/guide.md`\n    26→- **Sheet 14 [Inlet Drainage Area Map]:** Site drainage area map and rational method runoff calculations. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-14/guide.md`\n    27→- **Sheet 15 [Biofiltration-Detention Pond Plan & Calculations]:** Biofiltration and detention pond plan, details, and engineering calculations. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-15/guide.md`\n    28→- **Sheet 16 [Biofiltration-Detention Pond Profiles]:** Biofiltration pond profiles, outfall details, and comprehensive maintenance requirements. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-16/guide.md`\n    29→- **Sheet 17 [Conveyance Cross Sections]:** Conveyance cross-section graphs and corresponding site plan view. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-17/guide.md`\n    30→- **Sheet 18 [Austin Water General Information & Construction Notes]:** Austin Water general information, construction notes, and flow tests. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-18/guide.md`\n    31→- **Sheet 19 [Utility Tap Plan]:** Utility tap plan showing proposed water and wastewater connections. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-19/guide.md`\n    32→- **Sheet 20 [Utility Tap Public Plan & Profile]:** Utility tap public plan and profile for townhomes project. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-20/guide.md`\n    33→- **Sheet 21 [Preliminary Electrical Design Plan]:** Layout of preliminary electrical design, routing, transformers, and meters. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-21/guide.md`\n    34→- **Sheet 22 [Construction Details 1]:** Construction details for curbs, sidewalks, driveways, and bicycle parking. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-22/guide.md`\n    35→- **Sheet 23 [Construction Details 2]:** Standard construction details for water infrastructure, valves, and fire hydrants. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-23/guide.md`\n    36→- **Sheet 24 [Construction Details 3]:** Standard construction details for water services and trench repairs. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-24/guide.md`\n    37→- **Sheet 25 [Construction Details 4]:** Standard details, plan, and section views for fire line meters. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-25/guide.md`\n    38→- **Sheet 26 [Construction Details 5]:** Standard details for wastewater service connections and sewer cleanouts. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-26/guide.md`\n    39→- **Sheet 27 [Construction Details 6]:** Construction details for wastewater manholes and duplex grinder pumps. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-27/guide.md`\n    40→- **Sheet 28 [Construction Details 7]:** Construction details for storm drain manholes and catch basins. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-28/guide.md`\n    41→- **Sheet 29 [Addressing Plan]:** Site plan showing building layouts and individual unit addresses. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-29/guide.md`\n    42→- **Sheet 30 [Existing Tree Plan]:** Site plan displaying existing trees, protection measures, and care notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-30/guide.md`\n    43→- **Sheet 31 [Landscape Plan]:** Landscape design plan featuring planting details and irrigation notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-31/guide.md`\n    44→- **Sheet 32 [Tree List]:** This page provides a detailed list of surveyed trees. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-32/guide.md`\n    45→- **Sheet 33 [Canopy Impact Exhibit]:** Exhibits detailing tree canopy calculations and construction impact analysis. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-33/guide.md`\n    46→- **Sheet 34 [Root Zone Impact Exhibit]:** Critical root zone impact diagrams, calculations, and tree photos. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-34/guide.md`\n    47→- **Sheet 35 [Landscape Calculations]:** Provides landscape calculations, plant lists, and tree preservation notes. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-35/guide.md`\n    48→- **Sheet 36 [Biofiltration Pond Plans & Calculations]:** Detailed planting plans and calculations for the biofiltration pond. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-36/guide.md`\n    49→- **Sheet 37 [Landscape Details]:** Contains landscape details for tree planting, tree protection, and shrubs. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-37/guide.md`\n    50→- **Sheet 38 [Wall Plan]:** Plan view, section details, and notes for retaining walls. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-38/guide.md`\n    51→- **Sheet 39 [Wall Plan Details And Notes]:** Details and cross-sections for multiple pond retaining walls. → `primary-site-plan/sheet-39/guide.md`\n    52→\n    53→## Supplementary Documents\n    54→\n    55→1. **Project Review Form** (documentId: `e1c5768d-263b-4500-98ff-f6723ae5876c`) — A completed City of Austin form indicating applicable land development codes and site plan application details for the project. → `supplementary-docs/project-review-form/overview.md`\n    56→2. **Completeness Check Results** (documentId: `ba9815a3-047c-473a-a152-86ba84aae6d1`) — City of Austin site plan completeness check results detailing reviewer statuses and applicant responses to deficiencies. → `supplementary-docs/completeness-check-results/overview.md`\n    57→3. **Consolidated Site Plan Application** (documentId: `2fa9891b-9ede-4030-9300-cce670e070e1`) — Completeness check submittal for a consolidated site plan permit application in the City of Austin. → `supplementary-docs/consolidated-site-plan-application/overview.md`\n    58→4. **Master Comment Report** (documentId: `ca29fbe6-6361-4580-848e-7807ae462499`) — A comprehensive compilation of city staff review comments requiring updates for a site plan application. → `supplementary-docs/master-comment-report/overview.md`\n    59→5. **Erosion Control Fiscal E