{"level":30,"time":1776272594453,"pid":22798,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_0147YpcLJuZokZtsnY2hnerW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The site plan (Sheet 9) mentions utilities and easements but doesn't give specific transformer clearance information. I need to check the landscape plan for trees near transformers and also look for any detail sheets that might show transformer specifications. Let me also check the fire protection plan and look for other relevant sheets. Let me now check the vision on Sheet 9 to see if the transformers are visible on the main site plan with more detail.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5806,"cache_read_input_tokens":42670,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5806},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"210f7c66-b6ac-4c5e-b337-405e381dc733","uuid":"e0efb713-6f47-43de-9229-f81431670213"}
{"level":30,"time":1776272594741,"pid":22798,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":5,"runIndex":"run-2","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01XPFKXBZFme9HrE1ZUzLkwM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! The vision analysis has identified 4 transformer pads on Sheet 21. Key findings so far:\n1. NW transformer - close to property line, under a tree canopy\n2. W-Central transformer (near Building 2) - abutting/extremely close to building wall\n3. SW transformer (near Building 8) - abutting/extremely close to building wall  \n4. E Courtyard transformer (between buildings 5, 6, 7) - some spacing from buildings\n\nCritical issues noted:\n- No specific dimensions given for pads\n- No numerical clearances specified\n- No access door orientations visible\n- No bollards shown\n- Some pads appear too close to buildings\n\nNow I need to check other relevant sheets to verify utility separations, tree locations, fire protection concerns, and other clearance requirements. Let me check:\n1. Site Plan (Sheet 9) - overall layout\n2. Landscape Plan (Sheet 31) - for trees\n3. Fire Protection Plan (Sheet 10) - fire escapes, hydrants\n4. Utility plans for underground utility locations\n5. Grading plan for drainage direction\n\nLet me continue my research phase.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2075,"cache_read_input_tokens":40670,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2075},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"087c492d-743d-44d9-825a-fc630bc759d0","uuid":"78a46436-38c3-49b0-a9c8-14a64cc66009"}
