o not mention overhead utilities.\n*   The **\"General Notes\"** (such as Accessibility, Lighting, Trash Collection) do not address overhead lines.\n*   There is a standard **\"Texas 811 Call Before You Dig!!\"** warning box regarding underground utilities, but no specific directive regarding the overhead lines.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1481,"outputTokens":773,"totalTokens":3950,"reasoningTokens":1696},"warnings":[],"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":485470.594257,"endTime":510614.346526,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"0cTfaZnEGp6JueUPo4uwyAQ"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.03259","marketCost":"0.03259","inferenceCost":"0.03259","inputInferenceCost":"0.002962","outputInferenceCost":"0.029628","generationId":"gen_01KP91HKT9FBYVJ03GRX7JNWG0"}}},"messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on a visual analysis of the provided site plan (Sheet 9), here are the findings regarding the existing utility poles and overhead lines:\n\n**1. Are the existing utility poles and overhead utility lines shown from the existi