rance dimensions:**\n**No.** There are absolutely no dimension annotations indicating either horizontal or vertical clearances from the overhead poles or conductors to the proposed buildings, driveways, parking spaces, or retaining walls. The drawing includes standard site layout dimensions (like the 24' drive aisle width or building footprint dimensions), but nothing specifically targeting utility clearances.\n\n**5. Landscape/tree locations:**\nYes, there are tree symbols depicted near the overhead lines. Specifically, there are tree symbols located near the bottom-left property boundary (near the \"Begin Concrete Retaining Wall\" note) and near the bottom-right property corner (near the \"5' Elec. Easement\" note), placing them in close proximity to the \"- OHE -\" line.\n\n### Conclusion:\n**Deficiency identified.** While the overhead utilities (\"- OHE -\") and poles are clearly shown on the proposed site plan along the southern boundary, the required **clearance dimensions** (vertical or horizontal) verifying safe distances between these utilities and the proposed structures, driveways, or landscaping are completely missing from this sheet.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-