) visible next to or inside the tree symbols.\n*   **Reference to Plant List Sheet:** There is **no visible text or note** on this page that references a separate plant list sheet (such as Sheet 35) for species identification.\n\n**2. Mitigation Trees (\"M\") in the Bottom Right Corner:**\n\nLooking closely at the bottom right corner of the site plan, near the dashed line labeled **\"- OHE -\"**:\n\n*   **Location and Symbols:** There is a cluster of three trees in the immediate bottom-right corner, and a fourth tree located slightly further west along the southern property line.\n    *   The three trees clustered in the corner are represented by a circular symbol containing a diagonal cross (an 'x' shape).\n    *   The fourth tree further west is represented by a circular symbol containing a straight cross (a '+' shape).\n*   **Labels and Markers:** Each of these four trees has a small label reading simply **\"M\"** immediately adjacent to it.\n*   **Connection to Plant List:** There are **no numbers, additional letters, or other unique distinguishing marks** on or next to these four tree symbols. Because they only carry the generic category label \"M\", there is no visible reference key on this sheet that would tie these specific individual trees to a detailed line item on a plant list on Sheet 35.","providerMetadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}],"finishReason":"stop","usage":{"inputTokens":1444,"outputTokens":546,"totalTokens":4878,"reasoningTokens":2888},"warnings":[],"request":{"body":{"prompt":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"file","mediaType":"image/jpeg","data":"[BINARY_DATA_REMOVED - length: 1755680]"},{"type":"text","text":"# Your task\n\nYou are analyzing a subset of a real estate development site plan submission document.\n\nVisually analyze the binary file provided with extreme accuracy. Pay close attention to tables, reproducing them EXACTLY as they appear, character-by-character.\n\nCRITICAL: Do not paraphrase, interpret, or \"fill in\" tex