, parking structures, transformers, pull boxes) maintain the required 15-foot radial clearance from the outside conductor of overhead distribution conductors. Clearance distance verification with dimensioned plan and section exhibits required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.3","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Buildings 7 and 8 (roof eaves, overhangs, balconies projecting toward overhead utilities)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Building projections (roof eaves, overhangs, balconies) are shown on buildings located proximate to overhead electric conductors on the southern boundary. No building elevation sheets, section views, or dimension exhibits are provided verifying that projections maintain both the 7.5-foot horizontal sky-to-ground clearance and the 15-foot radial clearance from outside conductors. Building elevation and section exhibits with all projection dimensions and clearance annotations required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.6","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Buildings 7 and 8 adjacent to southern property boundary"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Buildings 7 and 8 are proposed in proximity to the southern property boundary where existing overhead electric facilities (poles and O.H.U.L.) are located. No surveyed clearance dimensions, setback annotations, or verification that buildings maintain minimum 7.5-foot horizontal sky-to-ground and 15-foot radial clearance from outside conductors are provided. Clearance verification with dimension annotations and surveyed conductor locations required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.7","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Buildings 7 and 8 (southern portion of site)"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Building elevation sheets showing proposed buildings adjacent to overhead electric conductors are not provided, nor are surveyed conductor elevations and clearance dimensions shown on any sheets. Registered surveyor data for overhead conductor elevations and mid-span clearance measurements required on building elevation sheets to demonstrate compliance with clearance requirements."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.8","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Buildings 7 and 8; southern driveway and parking areas"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Section and plan view exhibits showing dimensions from outer electric conductor to outermost edge of buildings and site features are completely absent from the submitted plans. Overhead electric facilities are shown on the site plan but no clearance dimension annotations are provided from the outside conductor to building faces, driveways, parking areas, or other structures. Detailed section views and enlarged plan details with dimension lines from outside conductor to building edges and site features required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.9","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Proposed fencing along property perimeter"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Proposed fencing is shown along property perimeter where overhead electric conductors exist. No dimension annotations are provided showing the clearance from the outside conductor of overhead facilities to fence lines or fence posts, measured horizontally to maintain the required 7.5-foot sky-to-ground clearance. Dimension annotations on site plan or detail sheets showing clearance from outside conductor to fence alignment required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.10","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Proposed fencing along property perimeter near utility poles"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Multiple overhead electric poles are located along the property perimeter boundaries. Proposed fence locations are shown on the site plan but no specific dimension annotations are provided confirming that fence posts maintain the required minimum 10-foot horizontal clearance from overhead electric poles. Dimension annotations showing post-to-pole distances required on site plan or fence detail sheets."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.13","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Proposed vehicle barrier fencing along southern property boundary"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Vehicle barrier fencing is proposed along the southern property boundary where overhead electric lines are located (O.H.U.L.). No vertical or horizontal clearance verification exhibits are provided. Section views with clearance dimensions from outermost electric conductor to barrier fence top, and plan views showing horizontal clearances, required to verify minimum 7.5-foot sky-to-ground clearance."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.14","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Retaining walls adjacent to southern property boundary"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":38}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Retaining walls are shown on site plan along property boundaries where overhead electric conductors are located. No dimension annotations are provided on the site plan or wall detail sheets showing the clearance from the outside conductor to the retaining wall face, measured horizontally to verify the required 7.5-foot sky-to-ground clearance. Clearance dimensions from outside conductor to wall face required on site plan or section detail sheets."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.17","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Retaining walls adjacent to overhead electric facilities"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":38},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":39}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Section exhibits showing retaining wall details are provided on Sheets 38-39, but none include dimensions from the outer electric conductor to the outermost edge of the retaining wall. No clearance dimension annotations showing horizontal distance from outside conductor to wall face are present. Section views with clearance dimensions from outside conductor to wall face required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.18","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.6.2"],"applicableAreas":["Southern driveway loop and parking areas"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"The southern driveway and parking areas are located in close proximity to existing overhead electric lines (O.H.U.L.) on the southern property boundary. Grading plan shows driveway grades but no vertical clearance dimensions are provided from the lowest point of overhead conductors to finished driveway surfaces. No mid-span clearance data or section views showing the required minimum 16-foot (parking without truck traffic) or 18-foot (areas with truck traffic) vertical clearance are provided. Section views with vertical clearance dimensions and determination of truck traffic classification required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.19","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.6.2"],"applicableAreas":["Parking areas beneath overhead electric lines"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Parking areas on site are located beneath or adjacent to overhead electric lines. No vertical clearance dimensions are provided on site plan or section views from lowest overhead line to parking surface, and no note regarding the clearance requirement is included on plans. Section views with vertical clearance dimensions and plan note confirming adequate clearance required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.22","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Southern driveway and parking areas near existing poles"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Existing electric poles are shown on the southern property boundary where proposed driveways and parking are located. No relocation notes are provided, nor are there dimension annotations confirming that poles are relocated to maintain minimum 30-foot distance from driveway edge. Verification of pole relocation (minimum 30 feet from driveway edge) or engineer notes addressing conflict resolution required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.23","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Throughout site plan and all utility plan sheets"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No clearance dimensions are shown anywhere on the plans from the outside conductor of overhead electric lines to proposed site features. Where dimensions are absent, this deficiency cannot be assessed; however, the complete lack of dimension annotations from outside conductors to buildings, driveways, parking areas, fences, trees, and retaining walls constitutes a failure to provide the required clearance verification. All clearance dimensions must originate from outside conductor location, not pole centerline. Comprehensive dimension annotations required on all relevant plan sheets."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.24","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Exterior lighting throughout site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Proposed exterior streetlight poles and site lighting are shown on landscape and site plans in proximity to existing overhead electric lines. No specific dimension annotations or clarification notes are provided confirming that new streetlight poles are located outside the routing of overhead electric lines or maintaining adequate clearance from overhead conductors. Confirmation that streetlight poles avoid overhead line routing, or clearance dimensions from outside conductor, required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.25","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Proposed sidewalks along Valley View Road frontage"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Existing power poles are located at property boundaries along Valley View Road where sidewalks are proposed. No plan notation or dimension annotations confirm that sidewalks are cleared (adequate horizontal distance maintained) from existing power poles at each end of the property along the right-of-way frontage. Clarification that sidewalks avoid pole locations or dimensions showing clearance from sidewalk to pole required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.26","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["Trash enclosure locations on site"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":31}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Trash enclosure locations are shown on the site plan in proximity to overhead electric lines. No dimensions or clearance verification is provided confirming that enclosed trash areas and receptacles are positioned to maintain minimum 7.5-foot sky-to-ground clearance from overhead conductors, considering that trash bins raised during service may contact overhead lines. Clearance dimensions considering full height of raised trash containers required."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.27","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Buildings 7 and 8; driveway; parking areas; all structures within electric easements"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":4},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":2},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa77