walk pass directly beneath the southern OHE line.\n*   **Buildings passing beneath:** No proposed buildings (Bldg. 1-8) pass directly underneath the overhead lines.\n*   **Potentially too close:** While \"too close\" depends on specific utility regulations and line voltages not provided on this sheet, the following areas represent tight constraints:\n    *   The extensive **retaining walls** along both the southern and eastern boundaries appear to be sited almost directly underneath or immediately adjacent to the overhead line routing. Construction activities (excavation, equipment operation) for these walls would occur in very close proximity to the lines.\n    *   **Bldg. 6** is the tightest building constraint, sitting visually ~15-20 feet from the eastern pole line. Depending on conductor swing under wind load, this may require verification against local utility clearance standards.","providerOptions":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":""}}}]}]},"providerMetadata":{"google":{"promptFeedback":null,"groundingMetadata":null,"urlContextMetadata":null,"safetyRatings":null,"serviceTier":null},"gateway":{"routing":{"originalModelId":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","resolvedProvider":"vertex","resolvedProviderApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","fallbacksAvailable":["google"],"planningReasoning":"System credentials planned for: vertex, google. Total execution order: vertex(system) → google(system)","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","finalProvider":"vertex","modelAttemptCount":1,"modelAttempts":[{"modelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","canonicalSlug":"google/gemini-3.1-pro-preview","success":true,"providerAttemptCount":1,"providerAttempts":[{"provider":"vertex","internalModelId":"vertex:gemini-3.1-pro-preview","providerApiModelId":"gemini-3.1-pro-preview","credentialType":"system","success":true,"startTime":764017.724839,"endTime":793803.412558,"statusCode":200,"providerResponseId":"fcXfabPdMfms8eEPypeK-Qw"}]}],"totalProviderAttemptCount":1},"cost":"0.044866