 § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Retaining walls along east and south property boundaries"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Concrete retaining walls are proposed along east and south boundaries with overhead electric distribution lines present above. No clearance dimensions from outside electric conductor to top of retaining wall face are provided on site plan or section views to verify minimum 7.5-foot sky-to-ground clearance."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.17","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Retaining walls on east and south boundaries"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Retaining walls are proposed near overhead electric lines. Section views or detail sheets lack dimension annotations showing clearances from outer electric conductor to outermost edge of wall for verification of compliance with UCM § 1.10.3 minimum clearance requirements."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.18","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.6.2"],"applicableAreas":["Main southern driveway entrance"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Proposed driveway passes directly beneath overhead electric distribution line on southern property boundary. No vertical clearance dimensions shown on grading plan or section views to demonstrate compliance with minimum 16-foot clearance (parking without truck traffic) or 18-foot clearance (areas with truck traffic). No mid-span clearance verification survey provided."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.23","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Entire site where overhead utility lines exist"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No clearance dimensions 