for niches)\n- Overhead electric lines (7.5-foot sky-to-ground; 15-foot radius)\n\n**4. Missing Infrastructure Verification**\n- Transformer pads NOT verified to be 100% on private property\n- Multiple site easements (25' drainage, 10' wastewater, 5' electric, 7.5' PUE) shown on plat but transformer location compliance not documented\n- Electrical routing from transformer to meters not verified as 100% private property\n\n**5. Missing Specifications & Details**\n- No cross-section drawings showing vertical clearances through access paths\n- No grading/drainage documentation showing surface flow direction (required for oil-filled equipment)\n- No bollard specifications despite transformer pads being adjacent to parking/driveways\n- No tree/vegetation species confirmation or ECM Appendix F utility-compatibility verification\n- No root barrier specifications for trees within 20 feet of transformers\n\n---\n\n### **APPLICABILITY TO THIS PROJECT**\nThis grouping is **fully applicable** — the site contains 4 transformer pads, multiple buildings, parking areas, utilities, easements, trees, retaining walls, and fire protection infrastructure that all require clearance verification per UCM § 1.10.4.\n\n### **DELIVERABLE**\nFindings have been returned in structured format as specified, with 28 deficiencies (5 fail + 23 not-verifiable) documented with code citations, locations, sheet references, and deficiency statements."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9039,"cache_read_input_tokens":72668,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9039},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a7087432-bcdb-4375-ad2d-45c773d38896","uuid":"a8c17e9e-1e12-40c4-b330-c77c8026fc18"}
