 12-inch horizontal and vertical clearance from transformer pads to other underground utilities cannot be verified. Underground electrical lines are shown connecting to transformer pads, and multiple utilities are shown on the electrical plan, but no clearance dimensions are provided."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.31","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Cross-section drawings showing vertical clearances in access paths with overhead structures are not provided. Transformer locations are shown on site plan, but no cross-section sheets demonstrate vertical clearances from overhead structures, parking garages, or enclosed areas to pad locations."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.32","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All four transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":11},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Grading plan drainage slopes relative to transformer pads cannot be verified. Equipment type (oil-filled vs. dry) is not specified on electrical plan. For oil-filled equipment, liquid flow must be directed away from building; this requirement cannot be assessed without knowing equipment type and reviewing drainage slopes."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.34","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["All transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pads may be located in or conflict with prohibited easements (drainage, water, sewer, overhead electric easements) without documented AE Design written approval. Easement locations are noted on site plan but not dimensioned relative to transformer pad locations; compliance cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.35","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["All four transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":2}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer easements are not shown on the site plan or plat. Required easements around transformer pads for Austin Energy accessibility are not depicted. Easement width adequate for AE Design accessibility requirements cannot be verified."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.36","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4 footnote 4"],"applicableAreas":["All four transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Electrical routing from transformer to meter 100% on private property cannot be verified. Electrical plan shows routing to electrical meters on building walls, but property line locations are not dimensioned relative to routing paths. Right-of-way routing cannot be ruled out."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.37","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.5.2.6","UCM § 1.18.0"],"applicableAreas":["All four transformer pad locations"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Transformer pad dimensions do not match or reference Austin Energy Design-approved transformer pad detail sheets. No pad dimensions (length, width, depth) are shown on the electrical plan. No AE Design-approved detail sheets for the specified service type (single-phase or three-phase) are referenced or provided. Service type determination is not documented."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-13.38","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.4 Table 1.10.4"],"applicableAreas":["All four transformer pad locations, particularly those adjacent to parking and circulation areas"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":21},{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Required 4-inch minimum diameter galvanized rigid metal post (bollards) placement cannot be verified. Electrical plan shows transformer pads located within or very near circulation aisles and parking areas, but no bollard details or specifications are shown. Without dimensioned distances to parking/traffic areas and without bollard detail sheets, compliance with the 4-foot proximity requirement cannot be verified."}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3336,"cache_read_input_tokens":74734,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3336},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"087c492d-743d-44d9-825a-fc630bc759d0","uuid":"9fe1b98c-4cc9-4dda-a833-f7f883091a89"}
