{"level":30,"time":1776273131998,"pid":22798,"hostname":"Williams-MacBook-Pro.local","step":"review-runs","item":"13.md","index":8,"runIndex":"run-3","type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Ed7QzKbkxsmKnroLm2sMko","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AGZknnmyog43qiMDmKStCC","name":"mcp__conductor_tools__vision","input":{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNum":2,"prompt":"This is the Plat for Valley View Townhomes. I need to assess the property boundaries and easements in relation to transformer pad locations shown on other sheets. The three transformer locations are:\n1. Northwest - west of Bldg. 1\n2. East-Central - between Bldgs. 4-5\n3. Southwest - west of Bldg. 8\n\nPlease provide:\n1. **Property boundary location** - Where is the property line relative to these transformer locations? Are the pads on private property or near the boundary?\n2. **Easements shown on plat** - What easements are depicted? Which ones are near or affect the transformer locations?\n3. **Utility easements** - Are there electric, water, wastewater, storm drain, or other utility easements shown? What are their dimensions?\n4. **Public vs. Private areas** - Which portions of the site are dedicated easements vs. private property?\n5. **Drainage easements** - Are there drainage easements that might contain or restrict the transformer pads?\n\nThe critical requirement is UCM § 1.10.4(Table 1.10.4) footnote 4, which states transformers must be located 100% on private property and NOT in certain easements like drainage, water, sewer, or electrical easements under overhead lines without written AE Design approval."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2138,"cache_read_input_tokens":60749,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2138},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"210f7c66-b6ac-4c5e-b337-405e381dc733","uuid":"93d15763-0f58-48f5-85f8-9ec65285e3ee"}
