ric lines. Section views or detail sheets lack dimension annotations showing clearances from outer electric conductor to outermost edge of wall for verification of compliance with UCM § 1.10.3 minimum clearance requirements."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.18","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.6.2"],"applicableAreas":["Main southern driveway entrance"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Proposed driveway passes directly beneath overhead electric distribution line on southern property boundary. No vertical clearance dimensions shown on grading plan or section views to demonstrate compliance with minimum 16-foot clearance (parking without truck traffic) or 18-foot clearance (areas with truck traffic). No mid-span clearance verification survey provided."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.23","status":"fail","codeCitations":["UCM § 1.10.3"],"applicableAreas":["Entire site where overhead utility lines exist"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"No clearance dimensions are shown on site plans at all. Code requires dimension lines originating from outside conductor location (not pole centerline), but no clearance dimensions of any type are provided on Sheet 9 or other drawings relative to overhead utility lines."},{"deficiencyId":"EL-1.25","status":"not-verifiable","codeCitations":["Reviewer Convention"],"applicableAreas":["West boundary sidewalk and pole location"],"sheetReferences":[{"documentId":"1144b126-1216-4dee-a89c-178950fa7777","sheetNumber":9}],"documentReferences":[],"comment":"Proposed 5-foot concrete sidewalk along western property boundary runs in proximity to existing utility pole in right-of-way. Clearance between sidewalk and pole location cannot be verified from available site plan dimensions to confirm that sidewalk is adequately cleared from pole at property end along ROW frontage."},{